        "TileImage": "$($repository 35b393a7-7b60-48d8-9507-7b1993daa7a9).Image",
        "Description": "Alright, I got another job.\r\rDown in Miami, the anual global innofation race is happening, with the superstar racecar driver Seirra Nox in my personal crew&apos;s eyesight. They&apos;re planning to kill Ms. Nox and shut down the Kronstadt arms dealer company. I know it hurts to take out my own team, but it is what it is. I can&apos;t smuggle ina disguise so you have to improvise. I think we make a great team.",
